 "summary_en": "Satakunta already runs a lung cancer early-diagnosis pathway in which GPs can send people straight to chest CT. It started as a pilot in 2022, became routine in 2024, has scanned about 170 patients and is now being evaluated. Tyks publishes lung cancer waiting times: 10 days from the decision to operate to surgery, and 35 days from referral to first chemotherapy (January–June 2025). The county is also planning the Satasairaala renewal project (a new acute hospital, up to €150M), but nothing on that page is specific to lung cancer.",
 "not_found_en": "I found no Satasairaala lung cancer waiting-time figures (only Tyks figures), and no pages on screening pilots, nurse navigators, reflex molecular testing, EBUS capacity, video MDT links with Tyks, or a lung cancer funding decision.",
